    Number of contacts to fetch, maximum is 100. Defaults to 20.
    """
    first: Int
  ): HubspotContactsConnection
}

"""
The root for Hubspot
"""
type HubspotQuery {
  """
  Get a company by its id. Company records store information about a business or organization
  """
  company(id: Int!): HubspotCompany!
  """
  List companies
  """
  companies(
    """
    Returns the elements in the list that come after the specified cursor.
    """
